    <labels>
        <fullName>Core_Banner</fullName>
        <categories>Core</categories>
        <language>en_US</language>
        <protected>false</protected>
        <shortDescription>Core_Banner</shortDescription>
        <value>&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=#00BFFF&gt;Welcome to 2021!&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;  
Sales CRM values have been updated to align to Sales BU priorities.   More details are available in &lt;b&gt;‘What’s New’&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://salescrm.intel.com/whats-new-2/#releaseupdates&quot;&gt;
HERE.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;
If your opportunity qualifies for a 2021 KPI, do not submit opportunity until the KPI is mapped on the opportunity.  This is typically ~24 hours after you update the opportunity.&lt;br&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Click to Register:&lt;/b&gt;  &lt;a href=&quot;https://learn.intel.com/Training/CourseDetails?ID=9225&amp;Type=2&amp;Lang=1&amp;iCurriculumID=4376,4378&quot;&gt;SMG Grow Design&lt;/a&gt; (WW4) and &lt;a href=&quot;https://learn.intel.com/Training/CourseDetails?ID=9226&amp;Type=2&amp;Lang=1&amp;iCurriculumID=4376,4378&quot;&gt;SMG GROW Deal&lt;/a&gt; (WW5) Overview Sessions.&lt;br&gt;
&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=#32CD32&gt;Managers:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; January 19th is the deadline to approve Design Win Revenue &amp; Deal Win Goals in Sales CRM for December 2020 credit.</value>
    </labels>
