    <labels>
        <fullName>Core_MDF_Case_Study_POP_Req_Info</fullName>
        <categories>POP Requirements Information</categories>
        <language>en_US</language>
        <protected>false</protected>
        <shortDescription>Case Study POP Requirements Information</shortDescription>
        <value>1.&amp;nbsp;Proof of Attribution (POA)&lt;br/&gt;
&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;a.&amp;nbsp;Final technical collateral meeting attribution requirements&lt;br/&gt;
&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;b.&amp;nbsp;Proof of Concept: if no case study or white paper agreed to, no POA required&lt;br/&gt;

2.&amp;nbsp;Proof of Cost (POC) – itemized invoice or report issued by a third party or member&lt;br/&gt;
&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;i&gt;Cost breakdown may include these types of details&lt;/i&gt;:&lt;br/&gt;
&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;a.&amp;nbsp;hardware costs and/or labor costs&lt;br/&gt;
&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;b.&amp;nbsp;end user name (if applicable)&lt;br/&gt;
&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;c.&amp;nbsp;member system, products and/or technologies featured or services performed&lt;br/&gt;

3.&amp;nbsp;Proof of Execution (POE) – covered by POA and/or POC</value>
    </labels>
