        <protected>false</protected>
        <shortDescription>Collateral POP Requirements Information</shortDescription>
        <value>1.&amp;nbsp;Proof of Attribution (POA) – digital media file(s) meeting attribution requirements&lt;br/&gt;
&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;a.&amp;nbsp;For giveaways: one photo per type of item showing Intel logo&lt;br/&gt;

2.&amp;nbsp;Proof of Cost (POC) – itemized invoice or report issued by the member or a third party&lt;br/&gt;

3.&amp;nbsp;Proof of Execution (POE) – report issued by the member or a third party&lt;br/&gt;
&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;i&gt;Report may include these types of details&lt;/i&gt;:&lt;br/&gt;
&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;a.&amp;nbsp;Number of pieces, media placement, delivery or postage unit cost and quantity&lt;br/&gt;
&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;b.&amp;nbsp;For digital versions: URL, hosting/placement unit cost and quantity</value>
