&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;b.&amp;nbsp;For collateral: include digital creative meeting attribution requirements&lt;br/&gt;

2.&amp;nbsp;Proof of Cost (POC) – itemized invoice or report issued by third party or member&lt;br/&gt;

3.&amp;nbsp;Proof of Execution (POE) – report issued by third party or member showing:&lt;br/&gt;
&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;a.&amp;nbsp;Dates and locations&lt;br/&gt;
&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;b.&amp;nbsp;For In-Store Promotion: include store IDs</value>
    </labels>
