    <labels>
        <fullName>Core_MDF_Media_OOH_Digital_Displays</fullName>
        <categories>Activity Creation</categories>
        <language>en_US</language>
        <protected>false</protected>
        <shortDescription>Core_MDF_Media_OOH_Digital_Displays</shortDescription>
        <value>An Intel customer develops, produces, delivers and places customer-specific signage advertisement(s) on third-party owned signage.</value>
    </labels>
    <labels>
        <fullName>Core_MDF_Media_Radio_Ad_Out_of_Store</fullName>
        <categories>Activity Creation</categories>
        <language>en_US</language>
        <protected>false</protected>
        <shortDescription>Core_MDF_Media_Radio_Ad_Out_of_Store</shortDescription>
        <value>Retailer to develop and play a radio ad across 100 stores. The radio ad shall last 60 seconds with at least 30 seconds dedicated to feature &lt;Intel-based focus&gt; devices, including the correct Intel processor mention and full Intel audio Sig ID as agreed between retailer and the Intel Account Manager.</value>
    </labels>
    <labels>
        <fullName>Core_MDF_Media_TV_Ad_In_Store</fullName>
        <categories>Activity Creation</categories>
        <language>en_US</language>
        <protected>false</protected>
        <shortDescription>Core_MDF_Media_TV_Ad_In_Store</shortDescription>
        <value>Retailer to install and play a video ad on all  from the  across 100 stores (around 1000 screens in total). The video shall last 60 seconds with at least 30 seconds dedicated to feature &lt;Intel-based focus&gt; devices, including the correct Intel processor logos (Exhibit A), processor mentions with appropriate trademarks (®/™), full Intel audio Sig ID and pre-approved Intel messaging as agreed between Retailer and the Intel Account Manager.</value>
    </labels>
    <labels>
        <fullName>Core_MDF_Media_TV_Ad_TV_Channels</fullName>
        <categories>Activity Creation</categories>
        <language>en_US</language>
        <protected>false</protected>
        <shortDescription>Core_MDF_Media_TV_Ad_TV_Channels</shortDescription>
        <value>Retailer to develop and play a video ad on different TV channels. TV ad production cost to be covered by Retailer. The video shall last 60 seconds with at least 30 seconds dedicated to feature &lt;Intel-based focus&gt; devices, including the correct Intel processor logos (Exhibit A), Intel processor mentions with appropriate trademarks (®/™), full Intel audio Sig ID and pre-approved Intel messaging as agreed between Retailer and the Intel Account Manager.</value>
    </labels>
