    </labels>
    <labels>
        <fullName>Core_MDF_Member_Event_POP_Req_Info</fullName>
        <categories>POP Requirements Information</categories>
        <language>en_US</language>
        <protected>false</protected>
        <shortDescription>Member Event POP Requirements Information</shortDescription>
        <value>1.&amp;nbsp;Proof of Attribution (POA)&lt;br/&gt;
&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;a.&amp;nbsp;For in-person events: at least two photo(s) from completely different angles meeting attribution requirements (for multi-location where attribution is identical, submit photos from only one location)&lt;br/&gt;
&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;b.&amp;nbsp;For virtual events: screenshot of online interface/presentation meeting attribution requirements&lt;br/&gt;

2.&amp;nbsp;Proof of Cost (POC) - sponsorship package with level details and cost. If sponsorship package is not available, event details with information on deliverables and cost.&lt;br/&gt;

3.&amp;nbsp;Proof of Execution (POE) – documentation showing evidence of execution of at least one activity specified in the sponsorship materials</value>
    </labels>
    <labels>
        <fullName>Core_MDF_Member_Manual_Hold</fullName>
        <categories>Claim Labels</categories>
        <language>en_US</language>
        <protected>false</protected>
        <shortDescription>Member Manual Hold</shortDescription>
        <value>Member Manual Hold</value>
    </labels>
    <labels>
        <fullName>Core_MDF_Member_Manual_Hold_Localized</fullName>
        <categories>Claim Labels</categories>
        <language>en_US</language>
        <protected>false</protected>
        <shortDescription>Member Hold</shortDescription>
        <value>Member Hold</value>
    </labels>
    <labels>
        <fullName>Core_MDF_Member_Owner</fullName>
        <language>en_US</language>
        <protected>false</protected>
        <shortDescription>Core_MDF_Member_Owner</shortDescription>
        <value>Member Owner</value>
    </labels>
    <labels>
        <fullName>Core_MDF_Member_com_POP_Req_Info</fullName>
        <categories>POP Requirements Information</categories>
        <language>en_US</language>
        <protected>false</protected>
        <shortDescription>Member.com POP Requirements Information</shortDescription>
        <value>1.&amp;nbsp;Proof of Attribution (POA) – digital media file(s) meeting attribution requirements&lt;br/&gt;
&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;a.&amp;nbsp;For graphic ads: URLs of digital proof(s) in XLS file (URLs must remain valid for the entire POP document retention period&lt;br/&gt;
2.&amp;nbsp;Proof of Cost (POC) – itemized report issued by member and/or a third party&lt;br/&gt;
&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;i&gt;Cost breakdown may include these types of details&lt;/i&gt;:&lt;br/&gt;
&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;a.&amp;nbsp;Type of costs, unit cost (cost per click, cost per thousand, cost per day, etc.), quantity, duration, size of banner, type of banner (when applicable)&lt;br/&gt;
&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;b.&amp;nbsp;If not placed through an ad network: Website name(s) and URL(s)&lt;br/&gt;
&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;c.&amp;nbsp;If placed through an ad network: average cost per unit, campaign name and ad network name&lt;br/&gt;
3.&amp;nbsp;Proof of Execution (POE) – same as POA</value>
