    <labels>
        <fullName>Core_MDF_Online_Intel_Promo_Page</fullName>
        <language>en_US</language>
        <protected>false</protected>
        <shortDescription>Core_MDF_Online_Intel_Promo_Page</shortDescription>
        <value>Retailer to implement and maintain a promopage on retailer.com. The page content shall be provided or pre-approved by Intel, featuring &lt;Intel-based focus&gt; devices with the correct Intel processor logos (Exhibit A), processor mentions with appropriate trademarks (®/™) and pre-approved Intel messaging as agreed between Retailer and the Intel Account Manager. Retailer shall run the activity as described until the end of the Timeframe. If any conditions stated above are not met, Intel reserves the right to reduce the amounts payable for the activity.</value>
    </labels>
    <labels>
        <fullName>Core_MDF_Online_Intel_Shop_in_Shop_SIS</fullName>
        <language>en_US</language>
        <protected>false</protected>
        <shortDescription>Core_MDF_Online_Intel_Shop_in_Shop_[SIS]</shortDescription>
        <value>Retailer to implement and maintain a shop in shop on retailer.com. The page content shall be provided or pre-approved by Intel, featuring &lt;Intel-based focus&gt; devices with the correct Intel processor logos (Exhibit A), processor mentions with appropriate trademarks (®/™) and pre-approved Intel messaging as agreed between Retailer and the Intel Account Manager. Retailer shall run the activity as described until the end of the Timeframe. If any conditions stated above are not met, Intel reserves the right to reduce the amounts payable for the activity.</value>
    </labels>
    <labels>
        <fullName>Core_MDF_Online_Intel_Shopper_Recommendation_Tool_SRT</fullName>
        <language>en_US</language>
        <protected>false</protected>
        <shortDescription>Core_MDF_Online_Intel_Shopper_Recommendation_Tool_[SRT]</shortDescription>
        <value>Retailer to implement and maintain the Shopper Recommendation Tool  on retailer.com. The page content shall be provided or pre-approved by Intel, featuring &lt;Intel-based focus&gt; devices with the correct Intel processor logos (Exhibit A), processor mentions with appropriate trademarks (®/™) and pre-approved Intel messaging as agreed between Retailer and the Intel Account Manager. Retailer shall run the activity as described until the end of the Timeframe. If any conditions stated above are not met, Intel reserves the right to reduce the amounts payable for the activity.</value>
    </labels>
    <labels>
        <fullName>Core_MDF_Online_Newsletter_PC_non_PC_products</fullName>
        <categories>Activity Creation</categories>
        <language>en_US</language>
        <protected>false</protected>
        <shortDescription>Core_MDF_Online_Newsletter_PC_non_PC_products</shortDescription>
        <value>Retailer to send out a Newsletter to its owned database or lawfully bought distribution list. The Newsletter   and shall feature &lt;Intel-based focus&gt; devices in a prominent position, including the correct Intel processor logos (Exhibit A), processor mentions with appropriate trademarks (®/™) and pre-approved Intel messaging as agreed between Retailer and the Intel Account Manager. The Newsletter shall link to the appropriate Intel landing page or product page on retailer.com.  Retailer shall run the activity as described until reaching either (a) the agreed Newsletter Circulation, or (b) the agreed conversions to the site. If any conditions stated above are not met, Intel reserves the right to reduce the amounts payable for the activity.  </value>
    </labels>
    <labels>
        <fullName>Core_MDF_Online_Onsite_Banner_Ad</fullName>
        <categories>Activity Creation</categories>
        <language>en_US</language>
        <protected>false</protected>
        <shortDescription>Core_MDF_Online_Onsite_Banner_Ad</shortDescription>
        <value>Retailer to include an online banner ad on the  site of [retailer.com.] The banner ad shall be placed in a prominent position and feature Intel-based focus devices, including the correct Intel processor logos, processor mentions with appropriate trademarks (®/™) and pre-approved Intel messaging as agreed between Retailer and the Intel Account Manager.</value>
    </labels>
    <labels>
        <fullName>Core_MDF_Online_Onsite_search_Cross_sell_keywords</fullName>
        <language>en_US</language>
        <protected>false</protected>
        <shortDescription>Core_MDF_Online_Onsite_search - Cross_sell_keywords</shortDescription>
        <value>Retailer to run a search campaign with   search terms on retailer.com. The search terms must be agreed with the Intel Account Manager prior to the launch of the search campaign. Above or next to search results the retailer shall display an online banner ad featuring &lt;Intel-based focus&gt; devices, including the correct Intel processor logos (Exhibit A), processor mentions with appropriate trademarks (®/™) and pre-approved Intel messaging as agreed between Retailer and the Intel Account Manager. The online text ad shall link to the appropriate Intel landing page or product page on retailer.com. Retailer shall run the activity as described until either (a) the agreed Number of Clicks or (b) the Number of Impression is reached. If any conditions stated above are not met, Intel reserves the right to reduce the amounts payable for the activity. Maximum reimbursement: 50% of campaign cost as shown by third-party invoice.</value>
    </labels>
    <labels>
        <fullName>Core_MDF_Online_Processor_Badges_on_listing_pages</fullName>
        <language>en_US</language>
        <protected>false</protected>
        <shortDescription>Core_MDF_Online_Processor_Badges_on_listing_pages</shortDescription>
        <value>Retailer to place the correct Intel processor logos (Exhibit A) next to all Intel-based devices on product listing pages. All Intel-based devices shall also display the correct and complete Intel processor mentions with appropriate trademarks (®/™).  Logo Size (pixels): min. 46 pixels high
Retailer shall run the activity as described until reaching either (a) the agreed Number of Impressions, or (b) the end of the Timeframe. If any conditions stated above are not met, Intel reserves the right to reduce the amounts payable for the activity.</value>
    </labels>
    <labels>
        <fullName>Core_MDF_Online_Processor_Fact_tags_Processor_Videos</fullName>
        <categories>Activity Creation</categories>
        <language>en_US</language>
        <protected>false</protected>
        <shortDescription>Core_MDF_Online_Processor_Fact_tags_Processor_Videos</shortDescription>
        <value>Retailer to place the correct Intel processor fact tag banner or the correct Intel processor video to match all Intel-based devices within the image library on product pages. All Intel-based devices shall also display the correct and complete Intel processor mentions with appropriate trademarks (®/™). 
Retailer shall run the activity as described until reaching either (a) the agreed Number of Impressions, or (b) the end of the Timeframe. If any conditions stated above are not met, Intel reserves the right to reduce the amounts payable for the activity.</value>
    </labels>
    <labels>
        <fullName>Core_MDF_Online_Processor_badges_on_product_pages</fullName>
        <language>en_US</language>
        <protected>false</protected>
        <shortDescription>Core_MDF_Online_Processor_badges_on_product_pages</shortDescription>
        <value>Retailer to place the correct Intel processor logos (Exhibit A) next to all Intel-based devices on product pages. All Intel-based devices shall also display the correct and complete Intel processor mentions with appropriate trademarks (®/™).  Logo Size (pixels): min. 46 pixels high
Retailer shall run the activity as described until reaching either (a) the agreed Number of Impressions, or (b) the end of the Timeframe. If any conditions stated above are not met, Intel reserves the right to reduce the amounts payable for the activity.</value>
    </labels>
