        <shortDescription>Core_MDF_Processing_Preference_HelpText</shortDescription>
        <value>Processing Preference applies if the claim is selected for Back-End Review.
Get paid, then settle – Best for accelerating cash flow; prioritizes time-to-money, and leaves the door open to possible future recovery.
Settle, then get paid – Best for minimizing post-payment recovery; prioritizes final resolution prior to payment, reduces risk of future recovery.</value>
