        <language>en_US</language>
        <protected>false</protected>
        <shortDescription>Radio POP Requirements Information</shortDescription>
        <value>1.&amp;nbsp;Proof of Attribution (POA) – digital media file(s) meeting attribution requirements&lt;br/&gt;

2.&amp;nbsp;Proof of Cost (POC) – itemized invoice issued by a media owner or marketing services agency&lt;br/&gt;

3.&amp;nbsp;Proof of Execution (POE) – transmission report issued by a third party showing:&lt;br/&gt;
&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;a.&amp;nbsp;Station or network name, spot lengths&lt;br/&gt;
&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;b.&amp;nbsp;For programmed broadcasts: number of spots, broadcast times, GRPs and/or cost per spot&lt;br/&gt;
&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;c.&amp;nbsp;For on-demand broadcasts: number of impressions&lt;br/&gt;
&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;d.&amp;nbsp;For sponsorship: program name, number of mentions</value>
    </labels>
