        <protected>false</protected>
        <shortDescription>InternalUsersLicenseReclaimEmailBody</shortDescription>
        <value>Hi All, 

Please note that as part of the Internal Users License cleanup, we are working on getting the salesforce licenses under limit, as part of which we have identified users who did not login from last 45 days and more, and plan to reclaim the same. 

PFA the impacted users which we have consolidated for the license removal.

Please let us know in case of any concerns regarding the license reclaim by next 3 days.

Thank you!</value>
    </labels>
